<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>NWR Historical Cost Predictor</title>
<style>
:root{--green:#4A6B3A;--dark:#2F4A25;--charcoal:#1A1A1A;--gray:#6B6B6B;--amber:#B8842A;--red:#B33A3A;--cream:#F5F1E8;--line:#D9D9D9;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{margin:0;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:var(--cream);color:var(--charcoal);}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--dark),var(--green));color:#fff;padding:28px 32px;}
.hero h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;}
.hero p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;opacity:.9;}
.tabs{display:flex;background:#fff;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);padding:0 24px;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.tab{padding:14px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray);cursor:pointer;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;text-transform:uppercase;}
.tab.active{color:var(--green);border-bottom-color:var(--green);}
.sheet{display:none;padding:24px 32px;max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto;}
.sheet.active{display:block;}
.panel{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.panel h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:var(--dark);text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:2px solid var(--cream);padding-bottom:10px;}
.builder-row{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-width:220px;}
.field label{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gray);text-transform:uppercase;}
.field select,.field input{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;background:#fff;}
.checkbox-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 0;}
.checkbox-field input{width:18px;height:18px;}
.checkbox-field label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--charcoal);text-transform:none;}
.btn{background:var(--green);color:#fff;border:none;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
.btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--green);border:1px solid var(--green);}
table.data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;}
table.data-table th{background:var(--green);color:#fff;padding:9px 10px;text-align:left;font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;}
table.data-table td{padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
table.data-table tr:nth-child(even){background:var(--cream);}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;}
.badge.high{background:#E8F0E4;color:#2F6B2F;}
.badge.med{background:#F7EFDD;color:var(--amber);}
.badge.low{background:#F7E4E4;color:var(--red);}
.num{text-align:right;}
.empty-state{padding:40px;text-align:center;color:var(--gray);}
.pct-pos{color:var(--red);font-weight:600;}
.pct-neg{color:#2F6B2F;font-weight:600;}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;}
.chip{background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px;}
.chip.excluded{background:#F7E4E4;color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);}
.chip.boosted{border-color:var(--amber);}
.chip .detail{color:var(--gray);font-size:10px;display:block;}
.chip .tags{font-size:9px;color:var(--green);font-weight:700;display:block;margin-top:2px;}
.chip .struct{font-size:9px;color:#7A5A1E;font-style:italic;display:block;margin-top:1px;}
.help-box{background:var(--cream);border-left:4px solid var(--green);padding:12px 16px;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:10px;}
.help-box.warn{border-left-color:var(--amber);}
.predict-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--dark),var(--green));color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:24px 0;}
.predict-hero .range{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0;}
.predict-hero .sub{font-size:13px;opacity:.9;}
.predict-hero .conf-row{margin-top:10px;}
.mini-stat{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:6px;padding:6px 12px;margin:0 4px;font-size:11px;}
.mini-stat b{display:block;font-size:15px;}
.split-hero{display:flex;align-items:stretch;}
.split-col{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:0 28px;}
.split-divider{width:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);margin:0 4px;}
.split-col-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;opacity:.85;margin-bottom:4px;}
.split-empty{font-size:13px;opacity:.75;padding:20px 10px;}
.crosscheck-flag{border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:12px 20px;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.crosscheck-flag.ok{background:#F3E6CC;color:#7A5A1E;border-top:1px solid #E0C98A;}
.crosscheck-flag.warn{background:#F7E4E4;color:#8A2A2A;border-top:1px solid #E8B8B8;}
.ptype-checkboxes{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;background:#fff;}
.ptype-checkboxes label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;text-transform:none;color:var(--charcoal);cursor:pointer;}
.ptype-checkboxes input{width:16px;height:16px;}
.market-boost{border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;margin-top:12px;background:#fff;}
.market-boost-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:6px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.market-boost-row input{width:16px;height:16px;}
.market-boost-row label{font-size:13px;}
.bugfix-banner{background:#E8F0E4;border:1px solid #2F6B2F;color:#2F6B2F;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;border-radius:6px;margin:0 32px;margin-top:16px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero"><h1>NWR Historical Cost Predictor</h1><p>Benchmark a new project against real NWR history — by market, product type, structural system, and trade &middot; 14 projects logged, ALL fields complete</p></div>
<div class="bugfix-banner">✅ Bug fix applied: Market Boost double-counting resolved — a project tagged with multiple boosted product types (e.g. High-Rise Tower + Podium) is now counted exactly once, not once per matching boost.</div>
<div class="tabs">
  <div class="tab active" data-sheet="builder">Project Builder</div>
  <div class="tab" data-sheet="alldata">All Logged Projects</div>
  <div class="tab" data-sheet="methodology">Methodology &amp; Cost Index</div>
  <div class="tab" data-sheet="marketfactors">Market Factors</div>
</div>
<div class="sheet active" data-sheet="builder">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Build a Project</h2>
    <div class="help-box warn">
      <strong>Structural System filter:</strong> Product Type alone can blend very different construction systems (e.g. a
      "High-Rise Tower" match might really be a cheaper podium-plus-tower combo). Use the Structural System filter to
      narrow to comparable construction types.
    </div>
    <div class="builder-row">
      <div class="field"><label>Market</label><select id="fMarket"><option value="">All Markets</option></select></div>
      <div class="field" style="min-width:320px;">
        <label>Product Type (select one or more)</label>
        <div class="ptype-checkboxes" id="ptypeCheckboxes"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="builder-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <div class="field" style="min-width:340px;">
        <label>Structural System (optional narrow filter)</label>
        <select id="fStructural"><option value="">Any structural system</option></select>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="builder-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <div class="field"><label>Units (for cost prediction)</label><input type="number" id="fUnits" placeholder="e.g. 250"></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Gross SF (for cost prediction)</label><input type="number" id="fGSF" placeholder="e.g. 350000"></div>
      <div class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" id="fInflation" checked><label for="fInflation">Adjust for inflation (2026 $)</label></div>
      <div class="checkbox-field"><input type="checkbox" id="fRecency" checked><label for="fRecency">Weight by recency</label></div>
      <div><button class="btn" id="buildBtn">Get Benchmarks</button></div>
    </div>
    <div id="marketBoostWrap"></div>
    <div class="chips" id="matchedProjectsChips"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="predictPanel" style="display:none;padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="padding:20px 24px 0;"><h2 style="border:none;">Predicted Total Project Cost <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);">(recency-weighted average, adjusted to 2026 dollars)</span></h2></div>
    <div style="padding:0 24px 20px;" id="predictWrap"></div>
    <div id="crossCheckWrap"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="projectDetailPanel" style="display:none;">
    <h2>Matched Project Detail <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);">(building efficiency, parking, site density)</span></h2>
    <div id="projectDetailWrap"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="resultsPanel" style="display:none;">
    <h2>Budget Variance by Trade <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);">(sorted by CSI division)</span></h2>
    <div id="varianceTableWrap"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="coResultsPanel" style="display:none;">
    <h2>Subcontractor CO Growth by Trade <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);">(sorted by CSI division)</span></h2>
    <div id="coTableWrap"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" id="noDataPanel" style="display:none;">
    <div class="empty-state">No historical projects match this filter combination yet.<br><span style="font-size:12px;">This is an honest result, not an error — NWR doesn't have a directly comparable project logged yet.</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="sheet" data-sheet="alldata">
  <div class="panel"><h2>All Logged Projects (14) — Every Field Complete</h2>
  <div class="help-box">All 14 projects now have fully verified Building Efficiency, Parking Ratio, and Site Acreage across all four comparison groups (High-Rise Tower, Podium, Townhome, Mid-Rise Wrap).</div>
  <div id="allProjectsWrap"></div></div>
</div>
<div class="sheet" data-sheet="methodology">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Recency Weighting</h2>
    <div class="help-box">Weight = 0.85 ^ (2026 &minus; cost basis year). Newer projects count more toward the average.</div>
    <div id="recencyTableWrap"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Inflation Adjustment — Cost Index Used</h2>
    <div class="help-box">All values are real, published Turner Building Cost Index figures.</div>
    <div id="costIndexTableWrap"></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="sheet" data-sheet="marketfactors">
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>Market Factors <span style="font-weight:400;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);">(empirical, derived from NWR's own logged projects)</span></h2>
    <div class="help-box warn">
      <strong>Confidence gating:</strong> A factor is only marked <span class="badge high">Confident</span> once BOTH markets have
      at least 2 logged projects of that product type. Treat "Reference only" factors as directional hints, not hard numbers.
    </div>
    <div id="marketFactorsWrap"></div>
  </div>
</div>
